{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenAPIKit"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentConfiguration"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DocumentConfiguration","externalID":"s:10OpenAPIKit21DocumentConfigurationO","roleHeading":"Enumeration"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration\/versionMapKey"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentConfiguration"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To instruct OpenAPIKit to decode OpenAPI Standards versions it does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"natively support, set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userInfo[DocumentConfiguration.versionMapKey] = [\"3.5.0\": OpenAPI.Document.Version.v3_1_1]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That will cause OpenAPIKit to accept OAS v3.5.0 on decode and treat it as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the natively supported v3.1.1. This feature exists to allow OpenAPIKit to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be configured to parse future versions of the OAS standard that are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"determined (by you) to be backwards compatible with a previous version"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prior to OpenAPIKit gaining official support for the new version and its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"features."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenAPIKit supports some additional Encoder\/Decoder configuration above and beyond"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what the Encoder or Decoder support out of box."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openapikit\/documentconfiguration"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenAPIKit/documentation/OpenAPIKit/DocumentConfiguration":{"url":"\/documentation\/openapikit\/documentconfiguration","title":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenAPIKit supports some additional Encoder\/Decoder configuration above and beyond"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what the Encoder or Decoder support out of box."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://OpenAPIKit/documentation/OpenAPIKit":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit","abstract":[],"title":"OpenAPIKit","url":"\/documentation\/openapikit"},"doc://OpenAPIKit/documentation/OpenAPIKit/DocumentConfiguration/versionMapKey":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openapikit\/documentconfiguration\/versionmapkey","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration\/versionMapKey","title":"versionMapKey","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"v